  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Counterpart 508293 Farmer and Nature Net</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FNN will be responsible to carry out the activities of piloting the grievance mechanism guideline. FNN will work with DAI and select ACs who are the members of FNN. FNN will select 162 participants (they are 64 AC executives and 80 Producer Group leaders/members,8 local authorities, 6 officers of District Office for Agriculture, Natural Management, and Environment, and 4 officers of Provincial Office for Agriculture Cooperative Promotion) to get involved in this action. The project will be implemented in 5 districts in Kampong Chhnang province. 8 Agriculture Cooperatives, who will sign contract farming with companies, will be selected to involve in the project activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FNN is village-based associations and networks of farmer (mostly rice farmers). The associations are playing an important role in promoting mutual help, solidarity and cooperation among villagers, as well as coordinating and undertaking collective actionin developing ecological agriculture, natural resources management, cooperative business practices and community development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmer and Nature Net Association</narrative>
  </participating-org>
